   "en": "Akuyaku Fureijou-sama to Oyobi!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "悪役腐令嬢様とお呼び!"
   },
   {
    "en": "Call Me Lady Villianess!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Nao Ōgami, a devoted fujoshi deeply passionate about BL, met a tragic fate in a sudden traffic accident—or so it appeared. To her astonishment, she found herself reincarnated as Clathiras Levanta, the antagonist character in the game Asteria Academy Chronicles!  In the game, Clathilas embodies the archetypal villainess: she mercilessly torments the heroine and ultimately meets her own demise—a predetermined fate. However, instead of being overwhelmed by such a sorrowful outcome… the reborn Nao Ōgami discovers something even more urgent:  This world lacks any notion of Boys’ Love?!"
  },
